          "text": "Témoignages: CAUMONT-SUR-DURANCE (84) 19.08.2017",
          "text_sha256": "075582682904fcd28ef0717506cd6372948b2719f5e20c6c5dd074604ad13bef"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
